- `/app/active_users_report.json` — 346 active users (input had 500 records with `active`, `inactive`, *and* `pending`; only `active` kept), each mapped to `{user_id, username, email, last_login, role_count, primary_role}`, dates parsed via `fromdateiso8601`/`strftime` (fractional seconds stripped first) into `YYYY-MM-DD`, sorted by `username`, 2-space indent.
